### Progression Formulas (User Customizable)
**Default Formulas:**
```javascript
// EXP Requirements (exponential growth)
expToNextLevel = Math.floor(50 * Math.pow(level, 1.5))

// Pack Unlock Frequency  
keystrokesPerPack = 1000 + (level * 100) // Gets harder as you level

// Shiny Rate Calculation
shinyRate = baseRate * (1 + qualityBonus) * (1 + streakBonus)

// Power Level Calculation
totalPower = sumOf(cardPowers) * levelMultiplier * collectionBonus
```

**Custom Formula Examples:**
